      "policy_quote": "This action can only be called once, and will change the order status to 'pending (items modified)'. The agent will not be able to modify or cancel the order anymore. So you must confirm all the details are correct and be cautious before taking this action.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must ensure that the user confirms all details are correct before modifying pending order items, as the action cannot be undone afterward."
    },
    {
      "target_id": "t0",
      "policy_source_id": "q11",
      "policy_quote": "In particular, remember to remind the customer to confirm they have provided all the items they want to modify.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must ensure the user confirms all modifications (e.g., removal and replacement of items) before proceeding."
    },
    {
      "target_id": "t1",
      "policy_source_id": "q11",
      "policy_quote": "An order can only be modified if its status is 'pending', and you should check its status before taking the action.",
      "requirement": "The assistant must verify that the order status is 'pending' before modifying its items."
